From the 1983 Adrian Lyne film "Flashdance" with Jennifer Beals, Michael Nouri, Lilia Skala, Sunny Johnson, Kyle T. Heffner, Lee Ving, Ron Karabatsos, Belinda Bauer & Cynthia Rhodes. - HD Film Tributes is a channel that currently has three hundred movie homages uploaded. I make zero money from YouTube as obviously none of this content will ever be monetized by me. Any and all ad revenue from these videos goes directly to Google as well as to the various copyright owners just as it should.